    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like i'm just \"carrying weight.\" it feels like i'm just taking up space. like a placeholder for someone who actually deserved to stay. how am i supposed to just move on and \"belong\" when it feels like the universe made a mistake by leaving me instead of them?",
