    "summary": "The user expresses profound survivor's guilt and a nihilistic sense that their existence is an error that needs to be \"corrected\" to balance a metaphorical ledger. The assistant responds by validating the intensity of the user's pain and refuting the logic of their suicidal ideation, while explicitly identifying the user's thoughts as irrational symptoms of their suffering.",
